				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 4. Fluent query builder\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQuery}} is a composable builder. Build a query, inspect it (the **Configuration** view shows your targets), then click the **▶ Run** toolbar button to execute it and get a full {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQueryResult}} with provenance.\n\nTry customizing this one:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-12T09:40:02.855891-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-12T09:40:02.855891-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "4/oZsMBpQ+GJw0RE1isfow=="
				},
				"code" : "| query |\nquery := Gt4SecurityQuery new.\nquery mobileOnly.\nquery publishedSince: Date today - 30 days.\nquery severityAtLeast: 7.0.\nquery limit: 50.\nquery \"inspect this — then click the ▶ Run button\""
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
