					"uidString" : "Edn2bzFGSMu8q17JE9L84g=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 5. Filter chains stay inspectable\n\nEvery filter on {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityVulnerabilityGroup}} returns another group — so you can chain `.highSeverity`, `.ecosystem:`, `.matching:`, `.malicious` and still get the full set of custom views at each step."
			},
