				},
				"string" : "## What's next\n\n- **Phase 5**: GT home card for one-click access, live Lepiter dashboard page\n- Full project details: {{gtPage:Gt4Security — Project Overview|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}\n- Data sources: {{gtPage:Gt4Security — CVE Source Comparison|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}\n- Implementation log: {{gtPage:Gt4Security — Implementation Plan|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}"
