				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 6. Incident catalog — threats that don't have CVEs\n\nMany mobile security events (EngageLab intent redirection, Pushwoosh espionage, SpinOk spyware, CocoaPods Trunk supply chain) have **no CVE entry** — they're tracked through vendor advisories and threat research. The {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityIncidentGroup}} catalogs 21 of these as inspectable domain objects with drill-through views.\n\nSee the full catalog on {{gtPage:Gt4Security — Mobile SDK & Library Tracker|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}."
			},
